From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:36:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: regulator: apple,pmic-touch-regulator: Add Angel
 analog supply
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The Angel PMIC (D2365) of the iPad 5 switches the analog supply of the
N1 touchscreen controller (ADT function pmuL(0x21f)). Add a compatible
for it and allow a regulator-touch-analog child on the PMIC.

Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
[Orchard: from brkosebay/linux 28c4b7e3 (J71t ledger 8.8); his
 apple,d2365-touch-analog node had its own driver and a reg property
 holding the PMIC register. It becomes a compatible of Paul Praschl's
 PMIC touch regulator binding, where the register is driver match data.]
Co-developed-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Signed-off-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,pmic.yaml        | 2 +-
 .../bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml       | 5 +++--
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,pmic.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,pmic.yaml
index 80ad51588..947f83928 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,pmic.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,pmic.yaml
@@ -73,7 +73,7 @@ patternProperties:
   "^nvmem(@[0-9a-f]+)?$":
     $ref: /schemas/nvmem/apple,pmic-nvmem.yaml
 
-  "^regulator-touch-(core|hv)$":
+  "^regulator-touch-(analog|core|hv)$":
     $ref: /schemas/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml
 
 required:
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml
index 5954379f7..b57af5246 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml
@@ -10,8 +10,8 @@ maintainers:
   - Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>
 
 description:
-  Fixed touchscreen supply switches provided by the Adelyn and Chestnut
-  PMICs. The compatible identifies both the PMIC and the physical supply;
+  Fixed touchscreen supply switches provided by the Adelyn, Angel and
+  Chestnut PMICs. The compatible identifies both the PMIC and the physical supply;
   register layout is an implementation detail of the regulator driver.
 
 allOf:
@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@ properties:
   compatible:
     enum:
       - apple,adelyn-touch-core-regulator
+      - apple,angel-touch-analog-regulator
       - apple,chestnut-touch-hv-regulator
 
 required:
